    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-804\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"120\" y=\"16\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">BFGS:  H\u2096\u208a\u2081 = (I \u2212 \u03c1sy\u1d40) H\u2096 (I \u2212 \u03c1ys\u1d40) + \u03c1ss\u1d40</text><rect x=\"27.0\" y=\"46\" width=\"50.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">I \u2212 \u03c1sy\u1d40</text><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"6.8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">wipe the old</text><text x=\"52.0\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"6.8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">info along y</text><rect x=\"81.0\" y=\"46\" width=\"20.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"91.0\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">H\u2096</text><text x=\"91.0\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"6.8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">old</text><text x=\"91.0\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"6.8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">model</text><rect x=\"105.0\" y=\"46\" width=\"50.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"130.0\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">I \u2212 \u03c1ys\u1d40</text><text x=\"130.0\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"6.8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">wipe the old</text><text x=\"130.0\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"6.8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">info along y</text><text x=\"164.0\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">+</text><rect x=\"173.0\" y=\"46\" width=\"40.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#d9dee7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"193.0\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03c1 s s\u1d40</text><text x=\"193.0\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"6.8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">add the hop</text><text x=\"193.0\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"6.8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">you flew</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"118\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03c1\u2096 = 1 / y\u2096\u1d40s\u2096 > 0 (Wolfe guarantees it)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"129\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u21d2 H\u2096\u208a\u2081 \u227b 0: the nose always points downhill</text><g transform=\"translate(224.0 14.0) rotate(0) scale(0.45)\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polygon points=\"12,0 5,-2.2 -9,-1.6 -9,1.6 5,2.2\"/><polygon points=\"3,0 -4,-10 -7,-10 -3,0 -7,10 -4,10\"/><polygon points=\"-8,0 -11,-4.5 -12.5,-4.5 -10.5,0 -12.5,4.5 -11,4.5\"/></g></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "BFGS sandwiches the old inverse model H\u2096 between (I \u2212 \u03c1sy\u1d40) and (I \u2212 \u03c1ys\u1d40), which wipe out its old information along the latest hop, then adds \u03c1ss\u1d40 for the hop just flown. With \u03c1\u2096 = 1/y\u2096\u1d40s\u2096 > 0 the new H\u2096\u208a\u2081 stays positive definite.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>The Gold Standard:</strong> Discovered independently by Broyden, Fletcher, Goldfarb, and Shanno (1970). It is universally recognized as the most robust unconstrained optimization algorithm.",
      "<strong>Dual Equivalence:</strong> BFGS is the exact mathematical <strong>dual</strong> of DFP obtained by swapping $B \\leftrightarrow H$ and $s \\leftrightarrow y$.",
      "<strong>Self-Correcting Robustness:</strong> Unlike DFP, BFGS possesses a self-correcting property: if an inaccurate step corrupts the Hessian estimate, subsequent iterations automatically damp out the error."
    ],
    "math": "$$H_{k+1} = \\left(I - \\rho_k s_k y_k^T\\right) H_k \\left(I - \\rho_k y_k s_k^T\\right) + \\rho_k s_k s_k^T, \\quad \\rho_k = \\frac{1}{y_k^T s_k}$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>The airplane analogy.</strong> BFGS is the autopilot that corrects its own gyro drift: each rank-two update keeps the curvature estimate positive definite and consistent with the flight log, so it is the standard choice.",
    "examTrap": "The direction is $p_k = -H_k g_k$, which requires ONLY matrix-vector multiplication ($\\mathcal{O}(n^2)$), NEVER matrix inversion ($\\mathcal{O}(n^3)$)! This gives Newton-like superlinear convergence at a fraction of the cost.",
    "hint": "Why is BFGS the preferred quasi-Newton update?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$\\rho_k=1/y_k^\\top s_k$ is one over the curvature measured along the last hop.</strong>",
      "<strong>$(I-\\rho sy^\\top)H(I-\\rho ys^\\top)$ filters the old estimate</strong> so it agrees with the new secant condition, and $+\\rho ss^\\top$ adds the new hop back.",
      "<strong>If $H_k\\succ0$ and $y_k^\\top s_k\\gt0$, then $H_{k+1}\\succ0$:</strong> every nose it produces points downhill."
    ],
    "stmtKind": "DEFINITION",
    "statement": "<b>BFGS update.</b> $B_{k+1}=B_k-\\dfrac{B_ks_ks_k^\\top B_k}{s_k^\\top B_ks_k}+\\dfrac{y_ky_k^\\top}{y_k^\\top s_k}$, equivalently $H_{k+1}=(I-\\rho_ks_ky_k^\\top)H_k(I-\\rho_ky_ks_k^\\top)+\\rho_ks_ks_k^\\top$ with $\\rho_k=1/(y_k^\\top s_k)$. It is the dual of DFP (swap $s\\leftrightarrow y$, $B\\leftrightarrow H$) and is self-correcting in practice.",
