    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-1206\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><circle cx=\"112.0\" cy=\"66.0\" r=\"46.0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"59.5\" y1=\"78.5\" x2=\"99.5\" y2=\"118.5\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><circle cx=\"79.5\" cy=\"98.5\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"71.5\" y=\"112.5\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-family=\"serif\" font-style=\"italic\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">x*</text><line x1=\"79.5\" y1=\"98.5\" x2=\"53.5\" y2=\"124.5\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-1206)\"/><text x=\"49.5\" y=\"138.5\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"serif\" font-style=\"italic\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">\u2212\u2207f</text><g transform=\"translate(126.0 26.0) rotate(-20) scale(0.7)\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polygon points=\"12,0 5,-2.2 -9,-1.6 -9,1.6 5,2.2\"/><polygon points=\"3,0 -4,-10 -7,-10 -3,0 -7,10 -4,10\"/><polygon points=\"-8,0 -11,-4.5 -12.5,-4.5 -10.5,0 -12.5,4.5 -11,4.5\"/></g><text x=\"112\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">ring x\u2081\u00b2+x\u2082\u00b2 = 1</text><text x=\"168\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">altitude</text><text x=\"168\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">f = x\u2081 + x\u2082</text><text x=\"168\" y=\"76\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">lowest: SW</text><text x=\"168\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">det B = \u22124\u221a2 &lt; 0</text><text x=\"168\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">= (\u22121)\u00b9 \u21d2 min \u2713</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "Minimise f = x\u2081 + x\u2082 on the ring x\u2081\u00b2 + x\u2082\u00b2 = 1. At the south-west point the bordered Hessian has det B = \u22124\u221a2 < 0, which matches (\u22121)\u1d56 with p = 1, so it is a strict local minimum.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>Problem:</strong> minimize $x_1+x_2$ on the circle $x_1^2+x_2^2=1$. Stationarity $1+2\\lambda x_i=0$ gives $x_1=x_2=-\\tfrac1{2\\lambda}$, so the candidates are $\\pm\\tfrac1{\\sqrt2}(1,1)$; take $x^*=(-\\tfrac1{\\sqrt2},-\\tfrac1{\\sqrt2})$ with $\\lambda^*=\\tfrac1{\\sqrt2}$.",
      "<strong>Second order:</strong> $\\nabla h=(-\\sqrt2,-\\sqrt2)$ and $\\nabla^2_{xx}\\mathcal{L}=2\\lambda^*I=\\sqrt2\\,I$, so $B=\\begin{bmatrix}0&-\\sqrt2&-\\sqrt2\\\\-\\sqrt2&\\sqrt2&0\\\\-\\sqrt2&0&\\sqrt2\\end{bmatrix}$ and $\\det B=-4\\sqrt2<0$, which is the required sign $(-1)^1=-1$. So $x^*$ is a strict local minimum.",
      "<strong>Cross-check:</strong> at the other candidate $+\\tfrac1{\\sqrt2}(1,1)$ we get $\\lambda^*=-\\tfrac1{\\sqrt2}$ and $\\det B=+4\\sqrt2>0$, which has the wrong sign: it is the maximum."
    ],
    "math": "$$\\det B = \\det \\begin{bmatrix} 0 & -\\sqrt{2} & -\\sqrt{2} \\\\ -\\sqrt{2} & \\sqrt{2} & 0 \\\\ -\\sqrt{2} & 0 & \\sqrt{2} \\end{bmatrix} = -4\\sqrt{2} < 0 = (-1)^1 \\implies x^* \\text{ is a strict local min}$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>The airplane analogy.</strong> The plane circles a circular no-fly ring and you want the lowest altitude $x_1+x_2$ on the ring. The lowest point is south-west at $(-1/\\sqrt2,-1/\\sqrt2)$: every step along the ring from there climbs, which is exactly what the bordered Hessian sign test confirms.",
    "examTrap": "If you tested the maximum at $(+1/\\sqrt{2}, +1/\\sqrt{2})$, you get $\\lambda^* = -1/\\sqrt{2}$ and $\\det B = +4\\sqrt{2} > 0$. Since $\\det B > 0 \\ne (-1)^1$, the SOSC fails, correctly detecting a local maximum!",
    "hint": "Does the sign of the bordered determinant confirm a minimum at the south-west point?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$B$'s border is the ring's normal;</strong> the inner block is the Lagrangian's Hessian at $x^*$.",
      "<strong>$\\det B=-4\\sqrt2\\lt0=(-1)^1$</strong> with one constraint ($p=1$) is exactly the sign pattern for a strict local minimum.",
      "<strong>If it were positive,</strong> the south-west point would be a maximum."
    ],
    "stmtKind": "WORKED EXAMPLE",
    "statement": "Worked bordered-Hessian check: at the KKT point of $\\min f$ subject to one equality constraint ($m=1$, $n=2$), the sign of $\\det B$ must equal $(-1)^m=-1$; here $\\det B\\lt 0$, confirming a strict local minimum.",
