    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-1404\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"72\" height=\"130\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d1d5db\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"8.0\" x2=\"80.0\" y2=\"138.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"12.6\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"12.6\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"21.9\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"21.9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"31.2\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"31.2\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"40.5\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"40.5\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"49.8\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"49.8\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"59.1\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"59.1\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"68.4\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"68.4\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"77.6\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"77.6\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"86.9\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"86.9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"96.2\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"96.2\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"105.5\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"105.5\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"114.8\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"114.8\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"124.1\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"124.1\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"133.4\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"133.4\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><g transform=\"translate(170.0 30.0) rotate(20) scale(0.8)\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polygon points=\"12,0 5,-2.2 -9,-1.6 -9,1.6 5,2.2\"/><polygon points=\"3,0 -4,-10 -7,-10 -3,0 -7,10 -4,10\"/><polygon points=\"-8,0 -11,-4.5 -12.5,-4.5 -10.5,0 -12.5,4.5 -11,4.5\"/></g><circle cx=\"170.0\" cy=\"30.0\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-family=\"serif\" font-style=\"italic\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">x\u2096</text><line x1=\"170.0\" y1=\"30.0\" x2=\"20.0\" y2=\"132.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u2212\u03b1\u2207f</text><path d=\"M80.0,62.0 L80.0,112.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/><circle cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"66.0\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">\u2713 accepted</text><circle cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"78.0\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">\u2717</text><circle cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"102.0\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">\u2717</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03b1 = \u1fb1, \u1fb1\u03c1, \u1fb1\u03c1\u00b2, \u2026 slide</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">along the wall (arc)</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">f(x(\u03b1)) \u2264 f(x\u2096) + c\u2081\u2207f(x\u2096)\u1d40(x(\u03b1) \u2212 x\u2096)</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "Try \u03b1 = \u1fb1, \u1fb1\u03c1, \u1fb1\u03c1\u00b2, \u2026; each trial x(\u03b1) = \u03a0(x\u2096 \u2212 \u03b1\u2207f) slides along the wall. Accept the first one whose drop is big enough: f(x(\u03b1)) \u2264 f(x\u2096) + c\u2081\u2207f(x\u2096)\u1d40(x(\u03b1) \u2212 x\u2096).",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>What:</strong> a straight ray $x_k-\\alpha\\nabla f(x_k)$ leaves $\\Omega$, so the line search must follow the bent path $x(\\alpha)=\\Pi_\\Omega\\big(x_k-\\alpha\\nabla f(x_k)\\big)$, the <em>projection arc</em>.",
      "<strong>How:</strong> backtrack $\\alpha=s,\\beta s,\\beta^2s,\\dots$ until the Armijo test along the arc holds: $f(x(\\alpha))\\le f(x_k)-\\tfrac\\sigma\\alpha\\|x_k-x(\\alpha)\\|^2$.",
      "<strong>Why it matters:</strong> the test measures progress with the displacement actually taken, $x_k-x(\\alpha)$, not with $-\\alpha\\nabla f$. The arc can bend along several faces of $\\Omega$, so many bound constraints can become active in one iteration."
    ],
    "math": "$$f(x(\\alpha))\\le f(x_k)+c_1\\nabla f(x_k)^\\top\\big(x(\\alpha)-x_k\\big),\\quad x(\\alpha)=P_C\\big(x_k-\\alpha\\nabla f(x_k)\\big),\\ \\alpha\\in\\{\\bar\\alpha\\rho^m\\}$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>The airplane analogy.</strong> Armijo along the arc: as you shorten the step $\\alpha$, the points $P(x_k-\\alpha\\nabla f)$ trace an arc that bends along the mountain wall. You try points on that arc and accept the first one that gives a big enough altitude drop, the sufficient-decrease check.",
    "examTrap": "Do NOT evaluate the Armijo gradient test against $-\\alpha \\nabla f(x_k)$! You must evaluate the reduction against the actual displacement vector $x_k - x(\\alpha)$, because that is the physical step taken.",
    "hint": "How does the pilot test a hop when the step slides along the wall?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$x(\\alpha)=P_C(x_k-\\alpha\\nabla f(x_k))$ traces an arc along the wall</strong> as $\\alpha$ changes.",
      "<strong>$c_1\\nabla f(x_k)^\\top(x(\\alpha)-x_k)$ is the promised drop:</strong> a fraction $c_1$ of the slope times the displacement you actually made (negative, so the right side is below $f(x_k)$).",
      "<strong>Try $\\alpha=\\bar\\alpha,\\bar\\alpha\\rho,\\bar\\alpha\\rho^2,\\dots$ and keep the first that earns it.</strong>"
    ],
    "stmtKind": "ALGORITHM",
    "statement": "<b>Armijo along the projection arc.</b> For trial steps $\\alpha=\\bar\\alpha\\rho^m$, let $x(\\alpha)=P_C(x_k-\\alpha\\nabla f(x_k))$; accept the first $\\alpha$ with $f(x(\\alpha))\\le f(x_k)+c_1\\nabla f(x_k)^\\top(x(\\alpha)-x_k)$.",
