    "highlighterClass": "highlight-amber",
    "title": "Adding a Blocking Constraint to the Working Set",
    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-1502\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"138\" y=\"14\" width=\"90\" height=\"118\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d1d5db\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><line x1=\"138.0\" y1=\"14.0\" x2=\"138.0\" y2=\"132.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"138.0\" y1=\"19.4\" x2=\"145.0\" y2=\"19.4\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"138.0\" y1=\"30.1\" x2=\"145.0\" y2=\"30.1\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"138.0\" y1=\"40.8\" x2=\"145.0\" y2=\"40.8\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"138.0\" y1=\"51.5\" x2=\"145.0\" y2=\"51.5\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"138.0\" y1=\"62.3\" x2=\"145.0\" y2=\"62.3\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"138.0\" y1=\"73.0\" x2=\"145.0\" y2=\"73.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"138.0\" y1=\"83.7\" x2=\"145.0\" y2=\"83.7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"138.0\" y1=\"94.5\" x2=\"145.0\" y2=\"94.5\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"138.0\" y1=\"105.2\" x2=\"145.0\" y2=\"105.2\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"138.0\" y1=\"115.9\" x2=\"145.0\" y2=\"115.9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><line x1=\"138.0\" y1=\"126.6\" x2=\"145.0\" y2=\"126.6\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/><g transform=\"translate(46.0 72.0) rotate(0) scale(1)\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polygon points=\"12,0 5,-2.2 -9,-1.6 -9,1.6 5,2.2\"/><polygon points=\"3,0 -4,-10 -7,-10 -3,0 -7,10 -4,10\"/><polygon points=\"-8,0 -11,-4.5 -12.5,-4.5 -10.5,0 -12.5,4.5 -11,4.5\"/></g><line x1=\"64.0\" y1=\"72.0\" x2=\"130.0\" y2=\"72.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-1502)\"/><circle cx=\"138.0\" cy=\"72.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"136\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"serif\" font-style=\"italic\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03b1\u2096 = (b\u1d62 \u2212 a\u1d62\u1d40x\u2096)/(a\u1d62\u1d40p\u2096) &lt; 1</text><line x1=\"140.0\" y1=\"72.0\" x2=\"190.0\" y2=\"72.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-1502)\"/><circle cx=\"186.0\" cy=\"72.0\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">x\u2096 + p\u2096 (\u03b1 = 1)</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">W\u2096\u208a\u2081 = W\u2096 \u222a {i}</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"32\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">(blocking wall joins)</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "Head for x\u2096 + p\u2096, but a wall i not in the working set is in the way. Stop where you hit it, \u03b1\u2096 = (b\u1d62 \u2212 a\u1d62\u1d40x\u2096)/(a\u1d62\u1d40p\u2096) < 1, and add it: W\u2096\u208a\u2081 = W\u2096 \u222a {i}.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>What:</strong> the equality subproblem proposes a full step $p_k$; if $x_k+p_k$ breaks an inactive constraint, you can only go part of the way and must stop at the wall you hit.",
      "<strong>How:</strong> only constraints with $a_i^Tp_k\\lt 0$ (moving toward the forbidden side) can block. The allowed fraction is $\\alpha_k=\\min\\big(1,\\ \\min_{i\\notinW_k,\\ a_i^Tp_k\\lt 0}\\frac{b_i-a_i^Tx_k}{a_i^Tp_k}\\big)$.",
      "<strong>Why it matters:</strong> the constraint that attains the minimum is the <em>blocking constraint</em>: set $x_{k+1}=x_k+\\alpha_kp_k$ and add it to the working set."
    ],
    "math": "$$\\alpha_k=\\min\\Big\\{1,\\ \\min_{i\\notin W_k,\\ a_i^\\top p_k\\lt0}\\frac{b_i-a_i^\\top x_k}{a_i^\\top p_k}\\Big\\},\\qquad W_{k+1}=W_k\\cup\\{i_{\\text{blocking}}\\}$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>The airplane analogy.</strong> Rolling along the runway toward the target, a mountain wall ahead stops you before you reach it: the step length is $\\alpha\\lt1$, you halt at the wall, and add that wall to the working set (the list of walls you are touching).",
    "examTrap": "Only consider constraints with $a_i^\\top p_k \\lt  0$ (direction pointing INTO the forbidden halfspace)! If $a_i^\\top p_k \\ge 0$, you are moving parallel to or away from constraint $i$, so it can never block your step.",
    "hint": "How far can the pilot roll before another wall stops him?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$\\frac{b_i-a_i^\\top x_k}{a_i^\\top p_k}$ = distance to wall $i$:</strong> the gap divided by how fast you approach it.",
      "<strong>Only walls with $a_i^\\top p_k\\lt0$ matter</strong> (you are heading toward them); the minimum over them is the first wall you hit.",
      "<strong>$\\min(1,\\cdot)$:</strong> a full step $\\alpha=1$ if nothing blocks, otherwise stop at the wall and add it to $W$."
    ],
    "stmtKind": "PROPOSITION",
    "statement": "If $p_k\\ne0$, take $\\alpha_k=\\min\\Big\\{1,\\ \\min_{i\\notin W_k,\\ a_i^\\top p_k\\lt 0}\\dfrac{b_i-a_i^\\top x_k}{a_i^\\top p_k}\\Big\\}$; if $\\alpha_k\\lt 1$ the minimizing (blocking) constraint is added to $W_k$.",
