    "drawingCaption": "The barrier \u2212\u03bc\u03a3 log(\u2212g\u2c7c(x)) blows up at the wall, so the plane never touches it. Minimising B(x; \u03bc) = f(x) \u2212 \u03bc\u03a3 log(\u2212g\u2c7c(x)) with smaller and smaller \u03bc lets it creep closer: x(\u03bc) \u2192 x*.",
