    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-1906\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"14\" y1=\"124\" x2=\"226\" y2=\"124\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-1906)\"/><line x1=\"14\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"226\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><text x=\"224\" y=\"32\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03bb* = \u22122</text><rect x=\"26\" y=\"104\" width=\"24\" height=\"20\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03bb\u2080 = 0</text><rect x=\"62\" y=\"72\" width=\"24\" height=\"52\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u22124/3</text><rect x=\"98\" y=\"54\" width=\"24\" height=\"70\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u221216/9</text><rect x=\"134\" y=\"45\" width=\"24\" height=\"79\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"146\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03bb\u2083</text><rect x=\"170\" y=\"40\" width=\"24\" height=\"84\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"182\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03bb\u2084</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03bb\u2096\u208a\u2081 = \u03bb\u2096 + c\u00b7h(x\u2096)</text><g transform=\"translate(210.0 60.0) rotate(180) scale(0.6)\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polygon points=\"12,0 5,-2.2 -9,-1.6 -9,1.6 5,2.2\"/><polygon points=\"3,0 -4,-10 -7,-10 -3,0 -7,10 -4,10\"/><polygon points=\"-8,0 -11,-4.5 -12.5,-4.5 -10.5,0 -12.5,4.5 -11,4.5\"/></g><text x=\"120\" y=\"32\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">small tuning turns, not brute force</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "\u03bb\u2080 = 0 gives x\u207d\u2070\u207e = (2/3, 2/3); \u03bb\u2081 = \u22124/3 gives (8/9, 8/9); \u03bb\u2082 = \u221216/9 gives (26/27, 26/27). Each update \u03bb\u2096\u208a\u2081 = \u03bb\u2096 + c\u00b7h(x\u2096) closes the gap, and \u03bb\u2096 \u2192 \u03bb* = \u22122 while x \u2192 (1, 1).",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>Problem:</strong> minimize $x_1^2+x_2^2$ s.t. $h(x)=x_1+x_2-2=0$ (solution $x^*=(1,1)$, $\\lambda^*=-2$). Use $\\mathcal{L}_c=x_1^2+x_2^2+\\lambda h+\\tfrac c2h^2$ with $c=2$, $\\lambda_0=0$. By symmetry set $x_1=x_2=t$: $\\partial_x\\mathcal{L}=2t+\\lambda+2(2t-2)=0\\Rightarrow t=\\frac{4-\\lambda}{6}$.",
      "<strong>Iteration 1:</strong> $\\lambda_0=0$ gives $t=\\tfrac23$, so $h=-\\tfrac23$ and $\\lambda_1=0+2(-\\tfrac23)=-\\tfrac43$. <strong>Iteration 2:</strong> $t=\\frac{4+4/3}{6}=\\tfrac89$, $h=-\\tfrac29$, $\\lambda_2=-\\tfrac43-\\tfrac49=-\\tfrac{16}9$. <strong>Iteration 3:</strong> $t=\\tfrac{26}{27}$.",
      "<strong>Pattern:</strong> $x^{(k)}=1-3^{-(k+1)}$ and $\\lambda_k-\\lambda^*=-2\\cdot3^{-k}$: the error drops by a factor of 3 each update while $c$ stays at 2."
    ],
    "math": "$$\\lambda_0=0\\to x^{(0)}=\\Big(\\tfrac23,\\tfrac23\\Big);\\ \\ \\lambda_1=-\\tfrac43\\to x^{(1)}=\\Big(\\tfrac89,\\tfrac89\\Big);\\ \\ \\lambda_2=-\\tfrac{16}9\\to x^{(2)}=\\Big(\\tfrac{26}{27},\\tfrac{26}{27}\\Big)\\to(1,1),\\ \\lambda^*=-2$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>The airplane analogy.</strong> Instead of ever-tighter fines, the tower nudges the reservation $\\lambda_{k+1}=\\lambda_k+c\\,h(x_k)$ by small corrections until the plane touches down on the boundary exactly: tuning, not brute force.",
    "examTrap": "Compare with the plain quadratic penalty, whose minimizer is x = c/(1+c)\u00b7(1,1): the error is 1/(1+c), so 1% accuracy needs c \u2248 100 (and a terribly conditioned Hessian). The augmented Lagrangian reaches 0.4% with c = 2 after 4 multiplier updates.",
    "hint": "How does $\\lambda$ climb to its target in the worked sequence?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$\\lambda_0=0$ gives $x^{(0)}=(2/3,2/3)$,</strong> a plane still short of the boundary.",
      "<strong>$\\lambda_1=-4/3$ gives $x^{(1)}=(8/9,8/9)$, and $\\lambda_2=-16/9$ is next:</strong> each update closes a fixed fraction of the remaining gap.",
      "<strong>The multiplier converges to $\\lambda^*$ and the plane lands on the constraint</strong> with the penalty $c$ held fixed."
    ],
    "stmtKind": "WORKED EXAMPLE",
    "statement": "Worked augmented-Lagrangian run: with fixed $c$, the update $\\lambda_{k+1}=\\lambda_k+c\\,h(x_k)$ drives $\\lambda_k$ to $\\lambda^*$ in a few outer iterations while $h(x_k)\\to0$.",
    "textbookImg": null,
    "textbookRef": null
