    "statement": "<b>Kolmogorov's axioms.</b> A function $\\mathbb P:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathbb R$ on a $\\sigma$-algebra $\\mathcal F$ of $\\Omega$ is a probability measure if (i) $\\mathbb P(A)\\ge0$ for all $A\\in\\mathcal F$; (ii) $\\mathbb P(\\Omega)=1$; (iii) for pairwise disjoint $A_1,A_2,\\ldots\\in\\mathcal F$, $\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{i}A_i\\right)=\\sum_i\\mathbb P(A_i)$ (Ross 2.3; Grimmett 1.3).",
