      "<strong>Boole's Inequality (Countable Subadditivity):</strong> For ANY sequence of events $A_1, A_2, \\dots$ (disjoint or overlapping): $\\mathbb{P}\\left( \\bigcup_{i=1}^\\infty A_i \\right) \\le \\sum_{i=1}^\\infty \\mathbb{P}(A_i)$.",
