"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">projective</text><text x=\"197\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">8 DOF</text><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"202\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"1 2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">h\u2083\u2081 = h\u2083\u2082 = 0 \u21d2 parallel lines stay parallel</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">h\u2083\u2081, h\u2083\u2082 \u2260 0 \u21d2 they meet at a vanishing point</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">H : 9 numbers \u2212 1 scale = 8 DOF</text></svg>",
